<p><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: Poppins;" data-fontfamily="Poppins">◀ <strong>8K@60Hz:</strong> 7.680x4.320 Pixel mit atemberaubenden Details</span></p> <p><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: Poppins;" data-fontfamily="Poppins">◀ <strong>40 Gbps:</strong> </span><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: Poppins;" data-fontfamily="Poppins">Maximale Geschwindigkeit für sofortige Datenübertragung</span></p> <p><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: Poppins;" data-fontfamily="Poppins">◀ <strong>Alt-Mode</strong>: DisplayPort-kompatibel</span></p> <p><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: Poppins;" data-fontfamily="Poppins">◀ <strong>Tragbarer Monitor</strong>: Anschluss an einen tragbaren Monitor</span></p> <p><span style="font-size: 18px; font-family: Poppins;" data-fontfamily="Poppins">◀ <strong>Externer Grafik</strong>: Verbindung zur diskreten GPU über die Dockstation </span></p> <p style="margin: 0in; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-size: 11pt;"> </p>
</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="shg-c " id="s-203556e2-f69f-4e9d-b1ae-177afbc63589"> <div class="shg-row" data-col-grid-mode-on=""> <div class="shg-c-lg-6 shg-c-md-6 shg-c-sm-6 shg-c-xs-12">
<div id="s-8342c208-9296-4b83-be95-0b720a74a4b1" class="shg-c "> <div class="shg-rich-text shg-default-text-content">
<p style="margin: 0in; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-size: 11pt; text-align: left; line-height: 44px;"> </p> <p style="margin: 0in; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-size: 11pt; text-align: left; line-height: 44px;"><span style="font-size: 36px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Kumbh Sans';">360°-LÜFTER</span></strong></span></p>
