<div class="shg-box-content"> <div id="s-804bfe30-7c32-4b33-92d9-822a62dab62a" class="shg-c "> <div class="shogun-icon-wrapper"> <div class="shg-fa shg-fa-hand-o-right shogun-icon" aria-label="Rocket"> </div> </div> </div> <div id="s-9f47d327-8e62-483f-9323-9e2ff9d51dd2" class="shg-c "> <div class="shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content">
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 28px; font-family: 'Kumbh Sans';" data-fontfamily="Kumbh Sans">Klassisches Design</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Kumbh Sans';" data-fontfamily="Kumbh Sans">Einfaches Öffnen des Deckels mit nur einem Klick Einfaches Hinzufügen/Austauschen von Speicherfestplatten. Einfacher zu bedienen!</span></p>
</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="shg-c-lg-6 shg-c-md-6 shg-c-sm-6 shg-c-xs-12"> <div class="shg-c shogun-image-container shg-align-center" id="s-7c382d0f-20b4-4466-a1e3-089a26778057"> <img src="https://i.shgcdn.com/8f4929cc-3541-4aef-86ce-d4f9d206d6d2/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/" width="" height="" alt="" class="shogun-image " decoding="async" loading="lazy"> </div> <script class="__SHG_DATA__" type="application/json">
