<p class="ql-direction-ltr" style="text-align: center; line-height: 26px;"><span style="font-size: 28px;">Vielfältige Anschlüsse </span></p>
<p class="ql-direction-ltr" style="text-align: center; line-height: 26px;"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Der NAB6 verfügt über 4 Typ-A-Anschlüsse, 3 Typ-C-Anschlüsse, um unterschiedliche Anforderungen zu erfüllen. </span></p>
</div> </div> <div class="shg-c shogun-image-container " id="s-a7f3db8f-b7a8-4034-b77f-a462240a8bb4"> <img src="https://i.shgcdn.com/ae697491-df28-42ac-a6a6-1ae2ab5a65f1/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/" width="" height="" alt="" class="shogun-image " decoding="async" loading="eager"> </div> <script class="__SHG_DATA__" type="application/json">
