<p style="margin: 0in; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 32px;"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Intel 7"-Technologie / Hybridarchitektur / Iris Xe-Grafik</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0in; font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei'; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 32px;"><span style="font-size: 20px;">Überragende Grafik- und Verarbeitungsleistung zur Unterstützung von Multitasking.</span></p>
</div> </div> <div class="shg-c shogun-image-container " id="s-ca30a33d-6469-4b55-92b6-d1549e4bded4"> <img src="https://i.shgcdn.com/30489a24-aabf-46eb-9e0a-eef59c0423ff/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/" width="" height="" alt="" class="shogun-image " decoding="async" loading="eager"> </div> <script class="__SHG_DATA__" type="application/json">
